title: "Reloj atómico ESP32-C3: NTP clock with weather on an OLED"
abstract: >-
  NTP clock with millisecond precision plus weather and rain forecast on an ESP32-C3 with an SSD1306 OLED, written in C with ESP-IDF v6.1.
